{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-074", "score": 0.104, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-074 | Study family SF-APPS-074: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3\n- observed_research_question: Gravity persistence: elite creator -> teammate PPP at lags 1-3\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: After an elite creator's signature action, teammates score more on the team's next k possessions with the same lineup on the floor.\n- observed_result: All 8 creators horizon=0. Jokic lag-1 ATT=+0.0282 CI[-0.043,+0.099] p=0.3779. CLEAN NULL on teammate PPP. Secondary: Antetokounmpo +0.075 distinct initiators over next 3 poss (perm p=0.0002, BH 0.003) ? structure not eff [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No elite creator produces a positive lineup-matched teammate-PPP lift at any lag.\n- observed_sample_and_power: Jokic lag-1 n=1880; Giannis n=1804; Doncic n=325\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF30\n- observed_verdict: null"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.103, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-014"}, {"id": "FAM:SF40", "score": 0.089, "document": "# FAM:SF40 | Study family SF40: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- observed_research_question: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific same-player and teammate X->Y sequences carry PPP premiums above Y's baseline.\n- observed_result: [APPA-053] Top same-player: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 n=31 t=+2.2; J. Brown +0.349 n=62; L. Doncic DRIVE->PNR +0.309 n=53. Top teammate: K. Towns->O. Anunoby DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.398 n=30; J. Brown->J. Tatum DRIVE->PN [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [APPS-038] Top: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 (n=31, t=+2.2). D. Mitchell SPOT_UP->DRIVE +0.279 (n=56, t=+2.8). Bottom: C. White DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.466 (n=37); D. Bane DRIVE->PNR -0.324 (n=70, t=-2.7). Most cells DIRECT [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-032", "score": 0.083, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-032 | Study family SF-CHT-032: Teammate DRIVE then PNR including calibrated labels then inferrer-only\n- observed_research_question: Teammate DRIVE then PNR including calibrated labels then inferrer-only\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Any teammate DRIVE preceding a PNR raises PNR PPP.\n- observed_result: League-wide including calibrated PNR: +0.022 PPP, p=0.004 (n=20,658 vs 159,623). Tatum +0.152 p=0.27. Inferrer-only DRIVE-PNR ATT=-0.006, p=0.76.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LABEL_ERROR\n- observed_failure_evidence: The +0.022 vanished to -0.006 once PNR was inferrer-only; calibrated-PNR temporal contamination.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n~180k including calibrated labels\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-005\n- observed_verdict: artifact_found\n- observed_failure_type: C_artifact"}], "n_results": 4}

